          "en": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: auto; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; padding: 25px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 15px; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n\n    <header style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <h1 style=\"color: #0f172a; font-size: 2.5rem; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1px;\">Support Group</h1>\n        <h2 style=\"color: #3b82f6; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 5px;\">Guidance & Community</h2>\n    </header>\n\n    <div style=\"background-color: #eff6ff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; border-left: 5px solid #3b82f6; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        <p style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #1d4ed8; margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.2rem;\">\n            🤍 For Women Who Experienced Stillbirth 🤍\n        </p>\n        <p>\n            A safe and inclusive space allowing for processing, sharing, and mutual support. The group is intended for women seeking comfort and community during the coping process.\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b;\">Facilitated by: Certified Midwives</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: #3b82f6; font-size: 1.3rem;\">Meeting Details:</h3>\n        <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding-left: 0;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                <span style=\"margin-right: 12px;\">👩‍⚕️</span>\n                <strong>Professionalism:</strong> Guidance by experienced, certified midwives.\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                <span style=\"margin-right: 12px;\">🤝</span>\n                <strong>Sharing:</strong> Discussion circles and emotional support in a protected environment.\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center;\">\n                <span style=\"margin-right: 12px;\">🎁</span>\n                <strong>Cost:</strong> Participation is free of charge.\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; background: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px dashed #3b82f6; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        🤍 <strong>We are here with you.</strong> 🤍<br/>\n        Support for women after stillbirth.<br/>\n        📞 <strong>Malka: <a href=\"tel:050-8946213\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #3b82f6;\">050-8946213</a></strong>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-around; text-align: center; gap: 15px;\">\n            <div>\n                <span style=\"display: block; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem;\">Guidance & Support</span>\n                <strong>Certified Midwives</strong>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <span style=\"display: block; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem;\">For Information & Registration</span>\n                <strong>Malka: <a href=\"tel:050-8946213\" style=\"color: #60a5fa; text-decoration: none;\">050-8946213</a></strong>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 20px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #64748b;\">📍 Additional Information:</h4>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 15px;\">\n            <div style=\"background: #f1f5f9; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n                <span style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 0.8rem; display: block;\">Field</span>\n                <strong>Emotional Support</strong>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"background: #f1f5f9; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n                <span style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 0.8rem; display: block;\">Target Audience</span>\n                <strong>Postpartum Women</strong>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"background: #f1f5f9; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n                <span style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 0.8rem; display: block;\">Status</span>\n                <strong>Free of Charge</strong>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
