        "content": {
          "he": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\">\n    \n    <div style=\"background-color: #1e3a8a; padding: 25px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\">\n        <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: 1px;\">מועדון ספורט ובריכה</h1>\n        <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 1.1rem;\">תוכנית הפעילות לגמלאים</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1f2937;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #1e40af; font-weight: bold;\">\n            <span>📅</span>\n            <span>ע\"פ התוכנית המעודכנת בשעות 08:00-13:00 בלבד.</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #334155;\">📋 מידע נוסף:</p>\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🔹 <strong>מתאים לגיל:</strong> גמלאים</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🔹 <strong>יום הפעילות:</strong> ימי א׳-ה׳</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🔹 <strong>מיקום:</strong> אולם הספורט</li>\n                <li>🔹 <strong>קישור לתוכנית המלאה:</strong> <a href=\"#\" style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\">תוכנית גמלאים 25-26</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #fdfdfd; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n            \n            <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem;\">\n                <span>🏊</span>\n                <span>💪</span>\n                <span>📚</span>\n                <span style=\"margin-right: 5px;\">בריכה • חדר כושר • העשרה</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #4b5563;\">\n                מנוי בוקר מוזל לגמלאים הכולל:\n            </p>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; line-height: 2;\">\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> בריכת שחייה\n                </li>\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> חדר כושר\n                </li>\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> סאונה חמה ורטובה\n                </li>\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> שיעורי עיצוב וחיזוק הגוף\n                </li>\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> הרצאות מתחומי הבריאות, הספורט, הגוף והנפש\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #fffbeb; border-right: 4px solid #d97706; border-radius: 4px;\">\n                <span style=\"display: block; color: #92400e; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;\">מחיר מיוחד:</span>\n                <span style=\"color: #d97706; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.025em;\">\n                    ₪ 193 <span style=\"font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500;\">לחודש</span>\n                </span>\n                <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #b45309;\">* ברכישת מנוי שנתי</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
          "en": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\">\n    \n    <div style=\"background-color: #1e3a8a; padding: 25px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\">\n        <h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.8rem; letter-spacing: 1px;\">Sports Club & Pool</h1>\n        <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 1.1rem;\">Seniors Activity Program</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1f2937;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #1e40af; font-weight: bold;\">\n            <span>📅</span>\n            <span>According to the updated schedule: 08:00-13:00 only.</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; color: #334155;\">📋 Additional Information:</p>\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🔹 <strong>Target Audience:</strong> Seniors</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🔹 <strong>Activity Days:</strong> Sunday - Thursday</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🔹 <strong>Location:</strong> Sports Hall</li>\n                <li>🔹 <strong>Full Program Link:</strong> <a href=\"#\" style=\"color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;\">Seniors Program 25-26</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #fdfdfd; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n            \n            <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.25rem;\">\n                <span>🏊</span>\n                <span>💪</span>\n                <span>📚</span>\n                <span style=\"margin-left: 5px;\">Pool • Gym • Enrichment</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #4b5563;\">\n                Discounted Morning Membership for Seniors includes:\n            </p>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; line-height: 2;\">\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> Swimming Pool\n                </li>\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> Fitness Center / Gym\n                </li>\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> Hot & Wet Sauna\n                </li>\n                <li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n                    <span style=\"color: #10b981;\">✔</span> Body Toning & Strengthening Classes\n                </li>"
        },
