          "en": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n    \n    <style>\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            h1 { font-size: 1.8rem !important; }\n            .grid-container { grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr) !important; }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <header style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 3px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <h1 style=\"color: #2980b9; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 0;\">Bridge Club</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 600; color: #3498db;\">🃏 Play, Learn, and Enjoy Together 🃏</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div style=\"background-color: #f0f7ff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 25px; border-left: 5px solid #3498db;\">\n        <p style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #2980b9; margin: 0;\">\n            <span style=\"margin-right: 8px;\">♠️</span>\n            A Social and Cognitive Experience:\n        </p>\n        <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-top: 15px;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">✨ Learning, practice, and play at various levels</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🧠 Improved memory and strategic thinking</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🌟 A fun, supportive, and professional atmosphere</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\">🎓 Guidance and support by an expert team</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <section style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; border-left: 5px solid #64748b;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #1e293b;\">🎓 Professional Instruction</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 1.1rem; color: #334155; margin: 10px 0;\">Join our bridge player community and enjoy the perfect blend of intellectual challenge and high-quality social gathering.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"grid-container\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #2980b9; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">♣️ Learn from Scratch</div>\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #2980b9; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">♦️ Guided Practice</div>\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #2980b9; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">♥️ Social Games</div>\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: bold; color: #2980b9; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">♠️ Family Atmosphere</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <section style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: #0f172a;\">📍 Contact Details & Information:</h3>\n        <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0;\">\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>🏢 Location:</strong> Beith Anoar, Jerusalem</li>\n            <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>📞 Phone for Information & Registration:</strong> 052-5688781</li>\n        </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer style=\"background-color: #1e293b; color: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: #f8fafc;\">The cards are already on the table!</h3>\n        <p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\">We look forward to seeing you among our players</p>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; color: #3498db;\">EASY BRIDGE - Simply Enjoy the Game</p>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>"
